        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wanonenuku manji akuwayisha nachu, nimashi adiŋi hakameŋa, wasampwili nihadi Aroni, nihamahinindi, nihadi anyanindi, nihamahinaawanyanindi kumu; wajilikili Aroni, nimahinindi, ni anyanindi, nimahinaawanyanindi kumu.",
